---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import Frame from "../../components/Frame.astro";
import StrategyIndex from "../../components/StrategyIndex.astro";
---
<Base title="Strategies" description="Every CL1! strategy tested or planned, with its stage and verdict.">
  <section class="wrap page">
    <h1>Strategies</h1>
    <p class="lede">Every strategy I have tested or planned on CL1! 1-minute bars. Each one goes through up to five stages:
    <strong>F1</strong> tests every setting, <strong>F2</strong> runs a narrow search, <strong>F3</strong>
    stress-tests that search, <strong>F4</strong> tries a prop-firm challenge and <strong>F5</strong> is one
    final check on reserved data. A tick means the stage is done, not that it passed.
    New here? Read <a href="/method/how-to-read/">how to read the results</a> first.</p>
    <Frame><StrategyIndex interactiveHeading="All strategies" /></Frame>
  </section>
</Base>
<style>
  .page {
    padding-top: 3.5rem;
  }
  .lede {
    margin: 1rem 0 2.5rem;
    max-width: 64ch;
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }
  .lede strong {
    color: var(--ink);
    font-weight: 550;
  }
</style>
